                <li><span>☁️</span> AWS Certified Solutions Architect – Associate</li>
                <li><span>☁️</span> AWS Certified Developer – Associate</li>
                <li><span>☁️</span> Microsoft Certified: Azure Fundamentals</li>
                <li><span>☁️</span> Google Cloud Associate Cloud Engineer</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2 class="sec-label">Mentoring</h2>
            <ul class="bullets">
                <li>Led planning and development of onboarding sessions tailored for interns and new hires.</li>
                <li>Enabled <strong>2 interns and 10 new hires</strong> to contribute effectively within 2 months through structured knowledge transfer.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

    </aside>

    <!-- RIGHT: EXPERIENCE -->
    <main class="main-col">
        <h2 class="sec-label">Experience</h2>

        <div class="company">
            <div class="co-hdr">
                <span class="co-name">Akamai Technologies</span>
                <span class="co-tenure">10 yrs 5 mo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="roles">
                <div class="role-row">
                    <div class="role-meta">
                        <span class="role-title">Senior Software Engineer II</span>
                        <span class="role-dates">Jun 2022 – Present</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="bullets">
                        <li>Built the <strong>Scraper Score</strong> detection system for Akamai Content Protector — classifying evasive bots via request-level signals before data exfiltration, protecting clients generating billions in annual revenue.</li>
                        <li>Architected the edge security metadata layer powering real-time bot detection across <strong>200M+ daily requests</strong>, reducing detection-to-route latency by ~35%.</li>
                        <li>Designed a DNS load balancer for Bot Manager's backend fleet achieving <strong>99.99% uptime</strong>, eliminating single-point-of-failure risk for Fortune 500 fraud-prevention infrastructure.</li>
                        <li>Drove 100% on-time migration of <strong>21 enterprise customers</strong> to production beta with zero SLA breaches, reducing post-migration support volume by ~40%.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="role-row last">
                    <div class="role-meta">
                        <span class="role-title">Senior Solutions Architect</span>
                        <span class="role-dates">Jan 2016 – May 2022</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="bullets">
                        <li>Accelerated CDN configuration deployment by ~30% for 10+ Fortune 500 customers by building repeatable Akamai-as-Code templates, reducing average deployment time and minimising configuration drift.</li>
                        <li>Shaped feature prioritisation across 3 platform-scaling initiatives, delivering structured beta feedback that accelerated product readiness.</li>
                        <li>Maintained a <strong>zero failed go-live record</strong> across 20+ enterprise deployments, owning end-to-end technical integration for each account.</li>
                        <li>Directly contributed to APAC regional quota attainment through 15+ enterprise pre-sales technical evaluations.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="company">
            <div class="co-hdr">
                <span class="co-name">Tech Mahindra</span>
                <span class="co-tenure">3 yrs 9 mo</span>
            </div>
            <div class="roles">
                <div class="role-row last">
                    <div class="role-meta">
                        <span class="role-title">Design &amp; Development Engineer <em>→ Software Engineer</em></span>
                        <span class="role-dates">May 2012 – Jan 2016</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="bullets">
                        <li>Delivered end-to-end API gateway implementations across 3 industry verticals, owning full-cycle policy development, SSL/TLS security setup, and production support with <strong>zero post-deployment incidents</strong>.</li>
                        <li>Drove Agile/SCRUM delivery across the full software lifecycle — functional and non-functional test strategy through production handoff.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="company last">
            <div class="co-hdr">
                <span class="co-name">BT (British Telecom)</span>
                <span class="co-tenure">4 mo</span>
            </div>
            <p class="co-sub">4-month contract · Belfast, UK</p>
            <div class="roles">
                <div class="role-row last">
                    <div class="role-meta">
                        <span class="role-title">Consultant</span>
                        <span class="role-dates">May – Aug 2015</span>
                    </div>
                    <ul class="bullets">
                        <li>Delivered <strong>£3M in infrastructure cost savings</strong> by migrating 500+ enterprise clients from legacy Sentry API gateway to Vordel cloud platform — zero downtime in 4 months through meticulous cutover planning and continuous C-suite stakeholder engagement.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>
</div>

<footer>
    <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Abhilash Honnavalli Puttaiah</span>
    <div class="foot-links">
        <a href="mailto:abilashhp69@gmail.com">abilashhp69@gmail.com</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/abilashhp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/abilashhp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
        <a href="/tools">Tools</a>
    </div>
</footer>

</Layout>

<style>
/* ─── NAV ─────────────────────────────────────── */
nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 48px; height: 56px;
    background: rgba(9,9,11,0.94);
    backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
}
.brand { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fafafa; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.brand:hover { text-decoration: none; color: #a1a1aa; }
.nav-right { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; }
.nav-right a { font-size: 0.825rem; font-weight: 500; color: #71717a; transition: color 0.15s; }
.nav-right a:hover { color: #fafafa; text-decoration: none; }
.nav-dl { border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.35) !important; color: #60a5fa !important; padding: 5px 14px; border-radius: 6px; }
.nav-dl:hover { background: rgba(59,130,246,0.08); color: #93c5fd !important; }

/* ─── HERO ────────────────────────────────────── */
.hero {
    position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    padding: 96px 48px 80px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
}
.hero-glow {
    position: absolute; top: -100px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 800px; height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(59,130,246,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-inner { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; text-align: center; }

.avail-badge { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; color: #71717a; margin-bottom: 24px; }

h1 { font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.2rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.05; color: #fafafa; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.role-line { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; color: #60a5fa; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.role-sub { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: #52525b; margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
.tagline { font-size: 1.05rem; color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 36px; }

.hero-btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 52px; justify-content: center; }

.btn-primary { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 12px 26px; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; font-size: 0.925rem; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 8px; transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s; }
.btn-primary:hover { background: #1d4ed8; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; transform: translateY(-1px); }
.btn-primary-outline { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 12px 26px; background: transparent; border: 1.5px solid #2563eb; color: #60a5fa; font-size: 0.925rem; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 8px; transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s; }
.btn-primary-outline:hover { background: rgba(37,99,235,0.1); text-decoration: none; color: #93c5fd; transform: translateY(-1px); }
.btn-ghost { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; padding: 11px 20px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 500; border-radius: 8px; transition: border-color 0.15s, color 0.15s; }
.btn-ghost:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.28); color: #e4e4e7; text-decoration: none; }

.metrics { display: flex; align-items: stretch; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
.metric { flex: 1; padding: 20px 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; }
.metric-sep { width: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); flex-shrink: 0; }
.metric-n { font-size: 1.65rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.04em; color: #fafafa; line-height: 1; }
.metric-l { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #52525b; line-height: 1.4; }

/* ─── KEY ACHIEVEMENTS ───────────────────────── */
.highlights {
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.015);
    padding: 32px 48px;
}

.highlights-inner {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 0;
}

.hl-card {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 0 32px;
}

.hl-card:first-child { padding-left: 0; }
.hl-card:last-child  { padding-right: 0; }

.hl-divider {
    width: 1px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    flex-shrink: 0;
}

.hl-icon {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
    line-height: 1;
}

.hl-title {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #e4e4e7;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.hl-desc {
    font-size: 0.775rem;
    color: #71717a;
    line-height: 1.55;
}

/* ─── TWO-COLUMN LAYOUT ───────────────────────── */
.page {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 48px 80px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 300px 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
}

/* ─── SIDEBAR ─────────────────────────────────── */
.sidebar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 72px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
}

/* ─── MAIN COLUMN ─────────────────────────────── */
.main-col { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }

/* ─── SECTION LABEL ───────────────────────────── */
.sec-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: #71717a;
    margin-bottom: 22px; padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
}

/* ─── ABOUT ───────────────────────────────────── */
.prose p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #a1a1aa; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.prose p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
.prose strong { color: #e4e4e7; font-weight: 600; }
.prose em { color: #a78bfa; font-style: normal; }

/* ─── SKILLS ──────────────────────────────────── */
.skill-table { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr; gap: 10px 16px; align-items: center; }
.sk-cat { font-size: 0.725rem; font-weight: 500; color: #52525b; }
.sk-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 5px; }
.pill { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #a1a1aa; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 500; }

/* ─── EDUCATION ───────────────────────────────── */
.edu-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
.edu-row { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
.edu-deg { font-size: 0.825rem; font-weight: 600; color: #d4d4d8; line-height: 1.4; }
.edu-school { font-size: 0.775rem; color: #52525b; }

/* ─── AWARDS ──────────────────────────────────── */
.award-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; }
.award-list li { font-size: 0.825rem; color: #71717a; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 8px; line-height: 1.5; }

/* ─── EXPERIENCE ──────────────────────────────── */
.company { padding-bottom: 36px; margin-bottom: 36px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
.company.last { border-bottom: none; margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }

.co-hdr { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.co-name { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; color: #e4e4e7; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
.co-tenure { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #52525b; }
.co-sub { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #52525b; font-style: italic; margin-bottom: 14px; }

.roles { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.role-row { padding: 14px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
.role-row.last { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }

.role-meta { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.role-title { font-size: 0.875rem; font-weight: 600; color: #d4d4d8; }
.role-title em { font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; color: #52525b; }
.role-dates { font-size: 0.775rem; color: #52525b; flex-shrink: 0; }

.bullets { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
.bullets li { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #71717a; line-height: 1.65; padding-left: 16px; position: relative; }
.bullets li::before { content: '–'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: #3f3f46; }
.bullets strong { color: #d4d4d8; font-weight: 600; }

/* ─── FOOTER ──────────────────────────────────── */
footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 24px 48px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #52525b; }
.foot-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
.foot-links a { color: #52525b; font-size: 0.8rem; transition: color 0.15s; }
.foot-links a:hover { color: #a1a1aa; text-decoration: none; }

/* ─── RESPONSIVE ──────────────────────────────── */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
    .page { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; padding: 48px 24px 64px; }
    .sidebar { position: static; }
    nav { padding: 0 24px; }
    .hero { padding: 60px 24px 52px; }
    .highlights { padding: 28px 24px; }
    .highlights-inner { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px; }
    .hl-card { min-width: calc(50% - 10px); padding: 0; }
    .hl-divider { display: none; }
    footer { padding: 24px; }
}
@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .nav-right { gap: 16px; }
    h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    .metrics { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .metric { min-width: 45%; }
    .metric-sep { display: none; }
}
</style>
